hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1768","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik din Safa par chadhey. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae subah ki (hamla) khabar! To Quraish Aap key paas jama huey. Unhon-ne kaha: Tumhey kya hua? Aap ne farmaya: Batao agar main tumhey khabar dun ke dushman tum par subah ya shaam hamla karney wala hai to kya tum mujhey sacha samjhoge? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main tumhaarey liye sakht azaab se pehley daraaney wala hun. To Abu Lahab ne kaha: Tumhaarey liye kharaabi ho! Kya isliye ham ko jama kya tha? To Allah ne naazil farmaya: (Abu Lahab key donon haath tootay). (Bukhari: 4801). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Ae merey bandon jinhon-ne apni jaanon par ziyaadti ki) aayat."
